@baseUrl = https://localhost:7226

### First log in with a confirmed GymAdmin or Trainer using Account.http.
### Keep the same cookie session. Fetch a NEW CSRF token after login.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/csrf

### Create a ficha only (201 + Location); no account, invitation, or email is created.
### Gym ownership comes from the session, never from the request body.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: <token-from-post-login-csrf-response>

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Smith",
  "email": "ana@example.com"
}

### List page 1 (default size 20), including inactive (200 object: items/page/pageSize/totalCount).
### This replaces the former array contract. No CSRF header needed for GET.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students

### Literal substring search across nombre/apellido/email, combined with state and trusted session gym.
### Search is trimmed, blank means no filter, maximum 320 raw characters. Defaults page=1/pageSize=20.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?page=1&pageSize=20&search=ana&activo=true

### Next page; page must be positive and pageSize 1..100. Invalid bounds/overflow return 400.
### Beyond the last page returns empty items with the same filtered totalCount.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?page=2&pageSize=20

### Optional strict boolean state filter. Omit activo for all fichas; invalid bool returns 400.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?activo=true

### Inactive fichas remain visible to direct lookup and can be edited without reactivation.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?activo=false

### Find a ficha (200); replace 1 with the created id or follow Location.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1

### Missing and cross-gym fichas return the same 404. Nonpositive ids return 400.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/2147483647

### Edit an existing ficha (200); replace 1 with an id from this session's gym.
### All three fields are required. No account, role, password, or ownership changes.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: <token-from-post-login-csrf-response>

{
  "nombre": "Ana Maria",
  "apellido": "Smith",
  "email": "ana.maria@example.com"
}

### All endpoints require login (401) and GymAdmin or Trainer (Student receives 403).
### Invalid/blank fields, invalid email, or email over 320 trimmed characters: 400.
### Email is trimmed and uppercased; duplicate within this gym: 409 ProblemDetails.
### The same email in another gym is allowed. All student responses use no-store.

### Deactivate logically (200 updated ficha with activo=false). No body; CSRF is still required.
### Both GymAdmin and Trainer can use both actions. Repeating either action is idempotent.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1/deactivate
X-CSRF-TOKEN: <token-from-post-login-csrf-response>

### Reactivate (200 updated ficha with activo=true). No account/login changes.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1/reactivate
X-CSRF-TOKEN: <token-from-post-login-csrf-response>
